
# Machine-regenerated by BaselineRegenerator (always writes "\n", see InterfaceSurface.NewLine).
# Forced to LF regardless of a developer's core.autocrlf setting, so the file that actually lands
# in git is byte-identical whether it was regenerated on Windows or Linux CI - otherwise a
# Windows git client would silently convert it back to CRLF on commit, undoing that guarantee.
Huddly.Sdk.ContractTests/Contract/ContractBaseline/**/*.approved.txt text eol=lf
